<title>ZIMBABWE: Eight people die in Zimbabwean collision. [CORRECTED 13:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Eight people die in Zimbabwean collision. [CORRECTED 13:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight Zimbabweans were killed when a bus collided with an oil tanker along a highway on Wednesday morning, police said.</p>
<p>They said 12 other people were injured (corrects from &quot;killed&quot; to &quot;injured&quot;) in the accident, which occured some 160 km (96 miles) east of the capital Harare.</p>
</text>
